msgstr "Yes. Ride with Pals charges a small 4% management fee on each transaction."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes. The club's News section allows users to comment on each post, with all the conversation kept together in a forum-style format."
msgstr "Yes. The club's News section allows users to comment on each post, with all the conversation kept together in a forum-style format."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes. You can create public activities."
msgstr "Yes. You can create public activities."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes. You can publish the same activity in as many clubs as you belong to. You can also make it public so that people outside your clubs can join."
msgstr "Yes. You can publish the same activity in as many clubs as you belong to. You can also make it public so that people outside your clubs can join."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes. You can schedule activities on a weekly, biweekly, or monthly basis."
msgstr "Yes. You can schedule activities on a weekly, biweekly, or monthly basis."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Yes. You can upgrade at any time."
msgstr "Yes. You can upgrade at any time."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "You can define the permissions available to administrators and members, such as creating news posts, creating activities, and sharing discounts. You can appoint as many administrators as you wish."
msgstr "You can define the permissions available to administrators and members, such as creating news posts, creating activities, and sharing discounts. You can appoint as many administrators as you wish."

